    "scenesThatPass": [
      "JOY: Wow. Best day of my life. It happened.\nRONNIE: Look at these animals. You think they’ve never seen a set of boobs in their life. We’re married to these people. Good luck, we just got shot…",
      "JOY: Come on, they’re not all bad.\nRONNIE: Joy, even the best dog is two meals away from bein’ a wolf.",
      "JOY: Who wants toast?\nCHRISTIE/JACKIE: I do/Me!\nBOBBY: Not me! I hate toast.\nJOY: Let’s not say ‘hate’. Toast is just cooked bread. How can you not like cooked bread?",
      "JOY: Right. Wow. Hi, it’s nice to meet you.\nVIV: Hi Joy! I’ve heard so much about you! I’d love to have you all over sometime and cook for you in my apartment!\nJOY: Oh. Um...yeah. Sure...",
      "JOY: You know, this is how people did it in the old days. They didn’t have automatic hot water. How’s that, is that warmer?\nJACKIE: I’m still cold mommy."
    ]
  },
